_and_power: n>=30 for lineup cells cited\n- auto_validation_status: no_validation_recorded; evidence: NOT_RECORDED\n- observed_method: Jokic/Curry/Doncic/Giannis; min-15 gate on 8 play types; opposing DEFENSE_LINEUP ~84% coverage; 272-row CSV."}, {"id": "FAM:SF-CHT-039", "score": 0.104, "document": "# FAM:SF-CHT-039 | Study family SF-CHT-039: Series-level AVOID share vs winning (talent confound)\n- observed_research_question: Series-level AVOID share vs winning (talent confound)\n- auto_outcome_status: untestable\n- observed_hypothesis: Higher AVOID share predicts losing, independent of team quality.\n- observed_result: Game-level rho=-0.19 p=0.008 (inflated n, team-quality confound). Series-level rho=-0.26 p=0.07 (n=50, underpowered; ~80 series needed for p<0.05). Low AVOID-share bin 52.6% vs 25-50% bin 37.0%.\n- auto_failure_mechanism: A_unanswerable (question not answerable with the data or design)\n- auto_limited_by: LIM:confounding\n- auto_limited_by: LIM:small_sample\n- auto_has_risk: RISK:CONFOUNDING\n- auto_has_risk: RISK:SAMPLE_SIZE_POWER\n- observed_failure_evidence: Series n=50 p=0.07; still confounded by team quality (OKC disciplined and good).\n- observed_sample_and_power: n=50 series; stated need ~80 for p<0.05\n- auto_validation_status: no_validation_recorded; evidence: NOT_RECORDED\n- observed_verdict: inconclusive"}, {"id": "FAM:SF-APPS-009", "score": 0.089, "document": "# FAM:SF-APPS-009 | Study family SF-APPS-009: Player routing V4 vs V5 direct scoring\n- observed_research_question: Player routing V4 vs V5 direct scoring\n- auto_outcome_status: untestable\n- observed_hypothesis: V5 player routing picks players with higher observed PPP than V4 routing.\n- observed_result: 8 divergences, 0 scoreable, 8 unscored (player missing from Neo4j); hit rate n/a.\n- auto_failure_mechanism: A_unanswerable (question not answerable with the data or design)\n- auto_limited_by: LIM:small_sample\n- auto_has_risk: RISK:DRIFT_NONSTATIONARITY\n- auto_has_risk: RISK:SAMPLE_SIZE_POWER\n- observed_failure_evidence: Scoreable 0 of 8; V5 mostly routed to 'team' rather than a player.\n- observed_sample_and_power: n=8 divergences, 0 scoreable\n- auto_validation_status: no_validation_recorded; evidence: NOT_RECORDED\n- observed_method: Series where V4 and V5 routed to different players; compare observed PPP (n>=5 each).\n- observed_verdict: inconclusive\n- observed_failure_type: A_unanswerable\n- auto_confidence: high (0.95)"}], "n_results": 4}

